    "created_at": "2024-09-16T15:53:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-16T15:53:24Z",
    "body": "From my own experiences, I believe it far more likely that whatever lag you're observing is a symptom of some performance bug in your code, or some misunderstanding of how to use events, not because of the performance cost of one simple mousemove handler.\r\n\r\nImplementers (Apple, Google, Mozilla) rarely add new API just for performance reasons, and certainly not without data. If there actually _is_ an issue here (which I'll admit I continue to doubt), you'll need to show a reproducible, measurable demonstration of the problem, not an anecdote.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
